<title>HUNGARY: Pannonplast plans 90 pct dividend.</title>
<headline>Pannonplast plans 90 pct dividend.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian plastics industrial company Pannonplast Rt plans to pay a 90 percent dividend or 90 forint a share, on its 1996 results, the company said on Friday.</p>
<p>Pannonplast paid a 70 percent dividend on the 1996 earnings.</p>
<p>Pannonplast's shares have a face value of 100 forints.</p>
<p>The company will hold its annual shareholders meeting on May 15.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
